select distinct ?item ?itemLabel ?itemDescription ?P31 ?P31Label ?P312 ?P312Label ?councilLabel ?location ?locationLabel with { 
  select ?item ?itemLabel ?itemDescription ?P31 ?P31Label ?council ?councilLabel  ?locationLabel  where {
  ?item wdt:P131 ?council . ?council wdt:P31 wd:Q15060255 .
  ?item schema:description ?itemDescription .
  filter(lang(?itemDescription)="en") 
  filter(strstarts(?itemDescription,"architectural structure in "))
} } as %i
WHERE
{
  INCLUDE %i
  ?item wdt:P31 ?P31 . filter (?P31 not in (wd:Q811979))   
  ?item wdt:P31 ?P312 .
  filter(str(?P31) > str(?P312))
  ?item wdt:P276 ?location .   
  ?location wdt:P31/wdt:P279* wd:Q486972. hint:Prior hint:gearing "forward".
  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "[AUTO_LANGUAGE],en". } 
}  order by ?councilLabel ?locationLabel 
